  "verseCount": 13,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "2",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "NAM 2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "2",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He that dasheth in pieces is come up before thy face: keep the munition, watch the way, make",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "thy",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NAM.2.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NAM.2.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "loins strong, fortify",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "thy",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NAM.2.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NAM.2.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "power mightily.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NAM.2.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NAM.2.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hath turned away the excellency of Jacob, as the excellency of Israel: for the emptiers have emptied them out, and marred their vine branches.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The shield of his mighty men is made red, the valiant men",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NAM.2.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NAM.2.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "in scarlet: the chariots",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "shall be",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NAM.2.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NAM.2.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "with flaming torches in the day of his preparation, and the fir trees shall be terribly shaken.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The chariots shall rage in the streets, they shall justle one against another in the broad ways: they shall seem like torches, they shall run like the lightnings.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He shall recount his worthies: they shall stumble in their walk; they shall make haste to the wall thereof, and the defence shall be prepared.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The gates of the rivers shall be opened, and the palace shall be dissolved.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Huzzab shall be led away captive, she shall be brought up, and her maids shall lead",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "her",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NAM.2.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NAM.2.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "as with the voice of doves, tabering upon their breasts.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But Nineveh",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NAM.2.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NAM.2.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "of old like a pool of water: yet they shall flee away. Stand, stand,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "shall they cry;",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NAM.2.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NAM.2.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "but none shall look back.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Take ye the spoil of silver, take the spoil of gold: for",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "there is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NAM.2.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NAM.2.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "none end of the store",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NAM.2.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NAM.2.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "glory out of all the pleasant furniture.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "She is empty, and void, and waste: and the heart melteth, and the knees smite together, and much pain",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NAM.2.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NAM.2.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "in all loins, and the faces of them all gather blackness.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.2.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Where",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NAM.2.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NAM.2.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the dwelling of the lions, and the feedingplace of the young lions, where the lion,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "even",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NAM.2.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NAM.2.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the old lion, walked,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NAM.2.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NAM.2.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the lion's whelp, and none made",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "them",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NAM.2.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NAM.2.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "afraid?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The lion did tear in pieces enough for his whelps, and strangled for his lionesses, and filled his holes with prey, and his dens with ravin.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Behold, I",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "am",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NAM.2.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NAM.2.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "against thee, saith the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NAM.2.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NAM.2.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "of hosts, and I will burn her chariots in the smoke, and the sword shall devour thy young lions: and I will cut off thy prey from the earth, and the voice of thy messengers shall no more be heard.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.2.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
